- Selected 5,000 listening queries from the project's historical training split.
- Attached artist metadata and derived historical relevance labels.
- Computed 128 historical DFS aggregates using the cumulative executor and
  retained log_id, artist_id, is_organic and track_length_seconds.
- Stored the resulting regression reference as Parquet on 2026-10-20.

